// segment_arena_backing_modeled_allocation_ledger_release_recycle_remaining_execution_prerequisite_ledger_box.hako -- MIMAP-342A
// Responsibility:
// - record the remaining model-only release/recycle execution prerequisites
//   from the execution support requirement matrix
// - keep requirements bundled while keeping every execution seam closed
// Non-responsibility:
